# Arabic + RTL

App default locale is `ar_EG`. Layout is RTL. Models keep `int` / `DateTime`; convert digits only in UI.

```dart
// BAD
Alignment.centerLeft
EdgeInsets.only(left: 18, right: 8)
'25'
Icons.arrow_back // without considering RTL

// GOOD
AlignmentDirectional.centerStart
EdgeInsetsDirectional.only(start: AppSpacing.xl, end: AppSpacing.sm)
25.toArabicDigits          // ٢٥
'العدد 12'.toArabicDigits  // العدد ١٢
```

- Import `package:rehla/core/utils/arabic_numerals.dart`
- Prices: `NumberFormat.decimalPattern('ar_EG')` or `AppPrice`
- Back chevron: AutoRoute / `Navigator.pop` with a direction-aware icon (`matchTextDirection: true`)
- Test long Arabic strings for overflow before finishing a screen
- `Directionality` is applied in `MyApp`; do not wrap individual screens unless a sub-tree must be LTR (e.g. a phone field)
